<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said it upgraded Westinghouse Electric Corp to &quot;outperform significantly&quot; from &quot;perform in line&quot;</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
